---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <Navbar currentPath="/auditions/" />

  <main>
    <section class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-8 text-center">Join Our Cast</h1>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <img
            src="/images/auditions/audition-graphic.jpg"
            alt="Join Our Cast"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-lg mb-6"
          />
          <p class="text-lg mb-6">
            For all who are interested in performing in our October 2026 production of
            <em>The Pirates of Penzance</em>, this page provides detailed information on
            both how to audition for a principal role AND how to join men's or women's chorus.
            Please be sure to read
            <a href="/auditions/info" class="text-primary hover:underline">
              IF YOU ARE PERFORMING WITH US
            </a>
            which contains important additional information about performing with us.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <a href="#principal" class="card flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-8 text-center hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
              <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🎭</div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Principal Roles</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Audition for a speaking/singing role</p>
            </a>
            <a href="#chorus" class="card flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-8 text-center hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
              <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🎵</div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Join Chorus</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-600">No audition required for chorus members</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 id="principal" class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">Audition for Principal Roles</h2>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Audition Dates & Times</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Sunday, June 14th</strong> - Starting at 6:00 PM</li>
            <li><strong>Tuesday, June 16th</strong> - Starting at 7:00 PM</li>
            <li class="text-secondary font-semibold">
              <strong>Callback Date (if needed):</strong> Tuesday, July 23rd, 7:00 PM
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Note: For both audition dates, you must check in and register no later than 8:30 PM.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Principal Roles</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Check out the character descriptions and their vocal ranges:
            <a href="/auditions/characters" class="text-primary hover:underline">
              View Character Breakdown
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Audition Location</h3>
          <p class="mb-2"><strong>Congregation Adath Israel</strong></p>
          <p class="mb-2">8 Broad Street, Middletown, CT 06457</p>
          <div class="mt-4 bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-sm">
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Food and beverages are not allowed inside Adath Israel.
            You may bring in bottled water or your own personal water bottle.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">What to Prepare</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li>
              <strong>Complete an Audition Form:</strong>
              <a href="/auditions/form" class="text-primary hover:underline">
                Download the PDF
              </a>
              or fill one out at the audition.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Bring Sheet Music:</strong> Prepare a song (preferably in English) that
              demonstrates your singing abilities. Bring a copy for our accompanist.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Mark Conflicts:</strong> Please identify any conflicts with our
              <a href="/auditions/schedule" class="text-primary hover:underline">
                rehearsal schedule
              </a>
              on the form.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Audition Process</h3>
          <ol class="space-y-3 list-decimal list-inside">
            <li>Check in with the person at the reception desk</li>
            <li>Submit your completed audition form</li>
            <li>Pick up additional handouts at the reception desk</li>
            <li>Sing a song of your choice</li>
            <li>Sing scales to determine your vocal range</li>
            <li>Read dialogue for your preferred role(s)</li>
            <li>May be asked to read dialogue for other roles</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Dance Assessment</h3>
          <p class="mb-2">
            In one of our early rehearsals, our choreographer will show you basic dance
            movements. You'll be grouped with other cast members and asked to perform
            these movements so we can assess your ability to learn and perform choreography.
          </p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-secondary">
            This information helps our choreographer and director when creating choreography.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 id="chorus" class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">Join Men's or Women's Chorus</h2>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <p class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
            YOU DO NOT HAVE TO AUDITION TO BE IN CHORUS!
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you have performed with us or with another G&S or musical theater group,
            or with a chorus or choir, and can carry a tune, you are welcome to join!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">How to Join</h3>
          <ol class="space-y-3 list-decimal list-inside">
            <li>
              Complete the
              <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfYZQDr9rq94-VEuRtzOcxYtsrM5m0GCYBR4b8xplvbRn-BFw/viewform" class="text-primary hover:underline">
                Chorus Registration Form
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>Identify any conflicts with our rehearsal schedule</li>
          </ol>
          <div class="mt-4 bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-sm">
            <p>
              <strong>Under 18?</strong> Please have a parent or guardian complete the
              <a href="/auditions/consent" class="text-primary hover:underline">
                Parental Consent Form
              </a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Dance Assessment (Same as Principals)</h3>
          <p>
            Chorus members also participate in the dance assessment during early rehearsals.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Need More Information?</h3>
          <p class="mb-2"><strong>Phone:</strong> 860-554-1256</p>
          <p class="mb-2"><strong>Email:</strong> jfreedman@snet.net</p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We'd love to hear from you! Feel free to call or email with any questions
            about auditioning or joining our chorus.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 card text-center">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">First Time Performer?</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you've never seen our shows before, we recommend watching some videos
            on our YouTube channel to get a sense of what our productions are like:
          </p>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@connecticutgilbertsullivan2348" class="inline-block btn-primary">
            Watch Our YouTube Channel
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
